'''Chroma Watergun''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2024 Summer Box|Summer Box]] in the [[Summer Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has ended.

== Appearance ==
It shares the same appearance as [[Watergun]], but it's general color scheme except the toggle pin, some parts of the cylinder and the barrel has been changed to continuously change color chromatically, essentially giving it a chroma color scheme, hence the name.

== Trivia ==
* It is the chroma counterpart to the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Watergun]].
* It is the first minor event [[Chroma Weapons|chroma weapon]].
** Additionally, this is the first summer chroma weapon.

